"I read your note," you say.
<br><br>

Robin goes very still. <<His>> hands close into fists on <<his>> knees. "Oh," <<he>> says. "I said to pretend you didn't."
<br><br>

<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
<<case "shy">>
	You stare at your knees. "I-I couldn't just pretend I never saw it. But I... I only see you as a friend. I'm sorry."
<<case "meek">>
